parameters.text:
=Plan a newsletter issue.

Topic: {{ $('Read the brief').first().json.topic }}
Audience: {{ $('Read the brief').first().json.audience }}
Tone: {{ $('Read the brief').first().json.tone }}
Number of sections: {{ $('Read the brief').first().json.sections }}

What is being published on this topic right now:
{{ ($json.results || []).map((r, i) => '[' + (i + 1) + '] ' + r.title + '\n' + String(r.content || '').slice(0, 600)).join('\n\n') }}

Choose exactly that many sections. Each one should answer a question this audience actually has, not repeat another section, and be supportable with a web search. Write a search query for each.

